    <string name="schedule_copy_from_desc">Adds that schedule\'s apps, services and websites to this one. Nothing here is removed.</string>
    <string name="info_focus_what">Focus blocks: commit to a stretch of time, and your phone becomes a brick until it ends.</string>
    <string name="info_focus_does">Sessions and breaks run by themselves until the end time. The phone stays pinned to this screen the whole time: only incoming calls, your alarm clock, Quick Settings (airplane mode, mobile data, hotspot) and any apps you allowed in timer settings work; allowed apps open from this page. Pick each session\'s subject during the break before it. Once a lecture has had about two-thirds of its time, a session ends by asking how the lecture is going.</string>
    <string name="info_focus_how">Exact alarms run the timer with no battery cost. The pin and app suspension are Android device-owner features; if the app ever crashes, the pin releases itself and suspension keeps blocking. Once committed, a block can\'t be ended early, not even with your recovery code. Emergency calls always work. The log counts hours and lectures per subject.</string>
